  "id": "fish-and-chips-with-peas",
  "name": "Fish and Chips with Peas",
  "subtitle": "Crisp crumbed fish, malt-vinegar potatoes, and minty peas",
  "description": "Coat white fish in mustard-seasoned crumbs and cook it alongside vinegar-steeped potatoes, then serve with tartar sauce and buttery mint peas.",
  "meal_type": "other",
